  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>By 9th level, your fearsome aura seeps deeply into the psyche of those who stand against you. A creature with immunity to fear instead has advantage on saves against your empath abilities. A creature who has advantage against being frightened does not benefit from that feature.</p><p>In addition, you gain the following mood manipulations: Fear of Missing Out and Intrusive Thoughts.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
